title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 6;
card-image: img/international.jpg
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Building ties with our fraternal communist parties.

At the Communist International, we can forge contacts with our fraternal communist parties in Europe and across the world.

- @fr: Build relationships with comintern delegates from the French Communist Party to move their governments in Germany's favor.
- @uk: Build relationships with comintern delegates from the British Communist Party to move their governments in Germany's favor.
- @ita: Build relationships with comintern delegates from the Italian Communist Party to move their governments in Germany's favor.
- @america: Build relationships with comintern delegates from the American Communist Party.
- @comintern: Build relationships with comintern delegates from small communist parties.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@fr
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; fr_met = 1 if fr_met = 0; conciliator_strength += 5

The Communists of France are open to an alliance with our delegation, and are able to sway their government to improve relations with us.

@uk
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; uk_met = 1 if uk_met = 0; thalmannites_strength += 5

The Communists of Britain are open to an alliance with our delegation, and are able to sway their government to improve relations with us.

@ita
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; ita_met = 1 if ita_met = 0; conciliator_strength += 5

The Communists of Italy are open to an alliance with our delegation, and are able to sway their government to improve relations with us.

@america
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; usa_met = 1 if usa_met = 0; thalmannites_strength += 5

The Communists of America are open to an alliance with our delegation.

@comintern
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1; comin_met = 1 if comin_met = 0

The Communists of smaller parties within the Comintern are open to an alliance with our delegation.

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
